<description>&lt;p&gt;The Cameroonian president has finally set a date for the long-delayed elections, while two Cameroonians serving in Russia’s army were reported killed, prompting the African Bar Association to call for mediation in the Anglophone crisis. The UN Human Rights Committee released findings on Cameroon and activist Agbor Balla warned that a decade of bloodshed still prevents children from safely returning to school in the conflict zones. A new video shows a trans woman attacked in Cameroon. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPXzJwQzdacmZCSDZkVC1iSndCaHpnNzU2d2dYUG1KaHRqSUhjc2VnT2RXSlVPZG5DSEtHNVBIdjhYN092TEtDZzRGZ1VoTUNNRGd0cEJTQlRodktieFVJNmk5WlllVE1VRU9JRWxUZHJrWng0NU42WXlBZUg4a3ZvUlFCZVV2ME9FdGgzel9Tb1Rrek5qa0Q2WjFTV1ZkanE1V2wtWDVzNzZ6Qm5LekdGYkwzX2_SAboBQVVfeXFMUFFyMXFaUldGdDh0YURXb3hKZ0loV3ozRnQ3dXdpY2xla2VlZnpwNFhQclBodHhUOUFORFBsbTdUTEVvYm5IT1RRRVZqdjVOU1ZWb1ktbkVMdW1rTnlRR01GZVI5ZE1VMklveFhFeExyTm9ScWRNZ1k3cldEaFdVZVh3bHhFZFFTSUtHWmF6RUpsODRrRTViMURjTUd1SnNwcUFGQ0h4RWN6Z2JjR21KV2ZEcGg1UHNRZk5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;kens5.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;UNITED24 Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQYnFlREZzam1ldXdIbDZOY0xUOW51eWpyVE9BbVdnN1EtdF9ESy1Id01YY1ItMHdFUG92NTk4SHV3Vnp5YmZ0MU8ySjFQRm5xMmlpb0lHQ1hNM3czRHFVMW9mUGtKSjFCNDVubXVtRDBWaGItS3laUkxRd0dMOVB5WmRZcHNuTnoxam5ZX2Q1VTF6QUpyZFlZQ2hpU2p4MzQ5cEdKZGFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sport News Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOMjZZbkFuLVNtdEZ3UFdJRE83VU9wM09TRUVCOVEtcVcyWGVyNVNXaldzbkMyVlJwRTBqeXhqcnFGSWlnelB3d2NwQmJjY2lWUlhqdmR2NUxLTWYxcHhmbWVQOFJSREtjZE0zZn